context
    Select estimate.md only from an explicit path or this conversation's exact
    record for the canonical project and ticket. Reject mismatches or ambiguous
    selection; never scan temporary directories. Read direct developer edits.
    Improve and publish require an existing file. Generate may create one only
    when none is known; a known missing file is an error. Create selects a fresh
    template and keeps older drafts. Templates and local improvements may have
    ticket null; bind an unassigned draft once for generation or publication.

    New drafts use a unique private OS temporary directory outside the canonical
    project, with 0700 directory and 0600 file permissions where supported.
    Record the absolute path, project, ticket, estimate kind, and directory
    ownership in conversation context. Create no repository task files or registry.
    Before saving or publishing, verify task identity is unchanged and the file
    still matches the text read for this action. Stop on concurrent edits.

    Keep Markdown on failed or uncertain publication. After verified publication,
    remove only the selected temporary file if it still matches the published
    text. Never follow links. Remove only an empty directory owned by this workflow
    and forget the cleaned path. Preserve other drafts and report any retained path.
as @draft_rules
